DETAIL:  The writers of "pairs_unjournaled" wait until the build of this index ends, as for CREATE INDEX on it, for as long as it takes to read the relation. The index goes with the last scope index that uses it.
HINT:  To build it without blocking the writers, name it, place it or keep it, make it first: CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY ON public.pairs_unjournaled USING sift_col (m, s) WITH (track_changes = 'ctid').
